---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import { facts } from '../data/facts';
import voiceStage from '../assets/shots/stage-crop.png';
---
<section class="group" id="grupo" aria-labelledby="grupo-t">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Para o seu grupo</p>
      <h2 id="grupo-t" data-reveal>Feito para quem joga junto.</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-reveal>Os canais de sempre, sem reaprender nada. A diferença é o que aparece primeiro: <strong>quem está aqui agora</strong>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <article class="cell agora" data-reveal>
        <div class="mock" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="m-label"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="3" y="5" width="2" height="6" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="7" y="3" width="2" height="10" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="11" y="5" width="2" height="6" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Agora</p>
          <div class="m-row">
            <span class="stack"><i class="av av-sky"></i><i class="av av-sun"></i><i class="av av-ink">DA</i></span>
            <span class="m-txt"><b>Sala de jogo</b><small>Noite de sexta · 3 em voz</small></span>
            <span class="m-join">Entrar</span>
          </div>
          <div class="m-row dim">
            <span class="stack"><i class="av av-plum">EN</i></span>
            <span class="m-txt"><b>Sala de foco</b><small>Estúdio · 1 em voz</small></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Abriu o app, já sabe onde o pessoal está.</h3>
        <p>"Agora" mostra quem está em voz e em qual sala. Um clique e você está junto.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell spaces" data-reveal style="--d:80ms">
        <div class="chan" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="c-head">Noite de sexta</p>
          <p class="c-sec">Texto</p>
          <p class="c-row on"><span class="h">#</span>geral</p>
          <p class="c-row"><span class="h">#</span>clipes</p>
          <p class="c-sec">Voz</p>
          <p class="c-row"><span class="h v"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><rect x="3" y="5" width="2" height="6" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="7" y="3" width="2" height="10" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/><rect x="11" y="5" width="2" height="6" rx="1" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>Sala de jogo<span class="c-n">3</span></p>
          <p class="c-row"><span class="h v"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 6h2l3-3v10l-3-3H3z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>Resenha</p>
          <span class="role">@moderação</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Espaços do jeito que o grupo já usa.</h3>
        <p>Canais de texto e de voz, cargos, apelidos, convites com prazo e limite de usos.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell chat" data-reveal style="--d:120ms">
        <div class="bubbles" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="b"><b>Bruno</b> alguém topa uma ranked?</p>
          <p class="b me"><b>Carlinha</b> bora, entro em 2 min</p>
          <p class="react"><span>👍 3</span><span>🔥 1</span></p>
        </div>
        <h3>Chat que acompanha a call.</h3>
        <p>Respostas, reações, @menções, anexos de até {facts.attachFreeMb} MB e rascunho guardado por canal.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell stage" data-reveal style="--d:160ms">
        <div class="shot" data-parallax="4">
          <Picture src={voiceStage} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[640, 960, 1280]} sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 560px, calc(100vw - 64px)" alt="Palco de uma chamada de voz no Alga Meet: dois participantes, quem fala com o anel índigo." loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <h3>Quem fala, acende.</h3>
        <p>Um anel índigo calmo segue a voz de cada um. Você sabe quem falou sem procurar.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cell casa" data-reveal style="--d:200ms">
        <span class="soon">Em breve</span>
        <h3>Casa: a vaquinha do grupo.</h3>
        <p>Quem quiser apoia pelo Pix e o espaço de todo mundo fica mais bonito. Não mexe na voz de ninguém.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .group { position: relative; padding-block: clamp(80px, 14vh, 160px); }
  .head { display: grid; gap: 16px; max-width: 760px; }
  .bento { margin-top: clamp(40px, 7vh, 72px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .cell {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px;
    min-height: 260px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012));
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-1), var(--top-light);
  }
  .cell h3 { font-size: 19px; }
  .cell p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-3); line-height: 1.5; }
  .agora { grid-column: span 3; }
  .spaces { grid-column: span 3; }
  .chat { grid-column: span 2; }
  .stage { grid-column: span 4; grid-row: span 2; justify-content: flex-start; }
  .casa { grid-column: span 2; background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 100% 0%, rgba(97, 99, 208, 0.22), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012)); }

  .mock { margin-bottom: auto; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg-1); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-2); }
  .m-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 590; color: var(--accent); padding: 0 4px 8px; }
  .m-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 6px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .m-row + .m-row { margin-top: 2px; }
  .m-row:first-of-type { background: rgba(150, 152, 255, 0.08); }
  .m-row.dim b { color: var(--text-2); }
  .stack { display: flex; }
  .stack .av + .av { margin-left: -8px; }
  .av { width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 10px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 590; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--bg-1); }
  .av-sun { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7c46c, #e86885); }
  .av-sky { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7cc0f5, #2f5ea8); }
  .av-ink { background: oklch(0.29 0.02 30); color: oklch(0.86 0.03 30); }
  .av-plum { background: oklch(0.29 0.02 295); color: oklch(0.86 0.03 295); }
  .m-txt { display: grid; line-height: 1.3; }
  .m-txt b { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 590; color: var(--text-1); }
  .m-txt small { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-3); }
  .m-join { margin-left: auto; height: 28px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 510; color: #fff; background: var(--sheen), var(--accent-fill); }
  :global(html.tier-a) .m-row:first-of-type .stack, :global(html.tier-b) .m-row:first-of-type .stack { animation: breathe 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes breathe { 50% { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.12); } }

  .chan { position: relative; margin-bottom: auto; padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg-1); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-2); display: grid; gap: 2px; }
  .chan p { font-size: 13px !important; line-height: 1.2 !important; }
  .c-head { font-weight: 590; color: var(--text-1) !important; padding: 2px 6px 8px; }
  .c-sec { font-size: 11px !important; color: var(--text-3); padding: 8px 6px 4px; }
  .c-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; height: 26px; padding: 0 6px; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--text-3) !important; }
  .c-row.on { background: rgba(150, 152, 255, 0.13); color: var(--text-1) !important; }
  .h { width: 14px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--text-3); }
  .on .h, .h.v { color: var(--accent); }
  .c-n { margin-left: auto; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-3); }
  .role { position: absolute; right: 12px; top: 12px; height: 22px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 11px; color: #cbc1e1; background: rgba(203, 193, 225, 0.1); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(203, 193, 225, 0.25); }

  .bubbles { margin-bottom: auto; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .b { justify-self: start; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 14px !important; color: var(--text-2) !important; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
  .b b { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 590; color: #a9c8f0; }
  .b.me b { color: #f0b6a0; }
  .react { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .react span { font-size: 12px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(139, 142, 247, 0.12); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 142, 247, 0.3); color: var(--text-2); }

  .shot { margin: -4px -4px 16px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08), 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); }
  .shot :global(img) { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 151 / 76; object-fit: cover; }
  .stage h3 { margin-top: auto; }
  .soon { align-self: flex-start; margin-bottom: auto; height: 24px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 590; color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-tint); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(139, 142, 247, 0.3); }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .agora, .stage { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: auto; }
    .spaces, .chat, .casa { grid-column: span 1; }
    .casa { grid-column: span 2; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .agora, .spaces, .chat, .stage, .casa { grid-column: auto; }
    .cell { min-height: 0; padding: 20px; }
  }
</style>
